    "text": "<p>Henry&#39;s constant (in kbar) for four gases <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi></math>&nbsp; and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#948;</mi></math>&nbsp;in water at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is given below :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable rowlines=\"solid\" columnlines=\"solid\"><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#948;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mn>50</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>(density of water <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>gm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> ) This table implies that :</p>"
